  "text": "proprium.pretiosissimi-sanguinis-domini-nostri-iesu-christi-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Most Precious Blood of Our Lord Jesus Christ” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "Through this divine rite, we beseech You, may we draw near to Jesus, the mediator of the new covenant, and renew upon Your altar, O Lord of hosts, the sprinkling of blood more eloquent than that of Abel. Through the same our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen."
    }
  },
